The GIF files in this folder show games made with open-game-works:
mana-clash.gif (https://github.com/wnsrn3436/open-game-works-game-mana-clash),
pong.gif (https://github.com/wnsrn3436/open-game-works-game-pong), card-duel.gif and
block-stack.gif (https://github.com/wnsrn3436/open-game-works-game-block-stack).

